  m_text: 'You have 3 minutes to defuse the bomb.

    - Cut the right wire with
    the wire cutters.

    - Plug the right fuse into its socket.

    - Type the
    secret code on the keypad.

    Read the manual on the other table to find out
    how. 3 mistakes and it explodes.'
